        "reference": "Deuteronomy 23:10",
        "book": "Deuteronomy",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "But it shall be, when evening cometh on, he shall wash himself with water: and when the sun is down, he shall come into the camp again.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 62
